          "summary": "Provides the first systematic evaluation of backdoor attacks against neuro-symbolic models, comparing DeepProbLog with baseline neural networks across eight backdoor settings and four reasoning tasks. Neuro-symbolic models are on average more robust than their neural counterparts, but their robustness depends heavily on the strictness of the enforced reasoning process and its compatibility with the chosen adversarial target.",
